  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Requires Midi QOL, DAE, Advantage Reminder for DND5e. This item comes from Kobold Press' Deep Magic 2, purchase at </em><a href=\"https://koboldpress.com/kpstore/product/deep-magic-volume-2-foundry/\" title=\"Deep Magic 2\"><em>https://koboldpress.com/kpstore/product/deep-magic-volume-2-foundry/</em></a></p><p><strong>GPS setup:</strong> Cast to activate the one-minute benefit. Use the Intimidation advantage prompt only against an eligible Beast or Humanoid; the benefit is consumed on use. A creature cannot be affected again until it finishes a long rest. Target eligibility and that rest restriction are adjudicated manually.</p>",
